{"file":"/home/goutev/repos/info-geometry-lean/external/SpectralThm/SpectralThm/Resolutions.lean","time":1778535958775,"baseTime":1778535957862,"changes":[{"range":{"start":{"line":78,"character":0},"end":{"line":137,"character":0}},"text":"/-- The positive measure associated with a resolution of identity and a vector `x`. -/\nnoncomputable def toMeasure {α : Type*} [MeasurableSpace α] (E : ResolutionOfIdentity α H)\n    (x : H) : Measure α :=\n  @VectorMeasure.ennrealToMeasure α _ ((E.toComplexMeasure x x).mapRange\n    ⟨fun z ↦ ENNReal.ofReal z.re, by simp, by intros; simp [Complex.add_re, ENNReal.ofReal_add]⟩\n    (by fun_prop))\n\nvariable (E : ResolutionOfIdentity α H)\n\n@[simp]\nlemma ResolutionOfIdentity.apply (w: Set α): E w = E.measureOf' w := rfl\n\nlemma toMeasure_apply {α : Type*} [MeasurableSpace α] (E : ResolutionOfIdentity α H)\n    (x : H) {w : Set α} (hw : MeasurableSet w) :\n    E.toMeasure x w = ENNReal.ofReal (⟪x, E w x⟫_ℂ).re := by\n  simp [toMeasure, VectorMeasure.ennrealToMeasure_apply hw, VectorMeasure.mapRange_apply, toComplexMeasure]\n","rangeOffset":3102,"rangeLength":3082}]}